            "description": "Per-candle value labels. `false`/absent (default) → none. `true` → each\ncandle's `close` value with the chart's numeric formatter. Object →\n`format(value)` and/or a `position` override. Default position is above the\ncandle. Labels are `aria-hidden` — the values already live in the accessible\nChartDataList."
          },
          "height": {
            "type": "number"
          },
          "hoverKey": {
            "description": "CONTROLLED synchronised hover key (FR-3). A candle's key is its `label` (the\ndate/category). When provided (string or null), the crosshair + tooltip track\nthis key instead of the chart's internal pointer hover (null ⇒ nothing shown),\nletting a parent share one hover channel across several aligned charts. Absent\n(`undefined`) keeps the legacy uncontrolled behaviour.",
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "keyboardNav": {
            "description": "FR-5 — keyboard navigation of the data points (roving tabindex). When `true`\n(or implied by wiring `onSelectKey`), a thin focusable overlay is rendered\nover the candles: the chart owns ONE tab stop, ←/↑/→/↓ move the focus between\ncandles (data order), Home/End jump to the first/last, Enter/Space select the\nfocused candle (`onSelectKey`), Escape leaves the navigation. Each focused\ncandle announces its `label` + O/H/L/C. Absent ⇒ no overlay, unchanged.",
            "type": "boolean"
